      "question": "Which Northstar Advantage patients are most likely to have a claim denied in the next 60 days?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-04T04:40:25.691098Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-04T04:40:59.348250Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "The prediction returned the top 25 Northstar Advantage patients ranked by likelihood of having a claim denied in the next 60 days. The model scored 226 Northstar Advantage patients total and returned the highest-risk 25.\n\n| Patient ID | Likelihood of claim denial in next 60 days |\n|------------|--------------------------------------------|\n| P001184 | 18.8% |\n| P000443 | 14.0% |\n| P001333 | 13.8% |\n| P000230 | 13.7% |\n| P000860 | 12.9% |\n| P000620 | 12.8% |\n| P000729 | 12.3% |\n| P000419 | 11.7% |\n| P001175 | 10.6% |\n| P000815 | 9.9% |\n| P001284 | 9.5% |\n| P000156 | 9.4% |\n| P000439 | 9.3% |\n| P000345 | 9.3% |\n| P000174 | 9.0% |\n| P001274 | 8.4% |\n| P000799 | 8.2% |\n| P000702 | 8.2% |\n| P000329 | 7.7% |\n| P000305 | 7.6% |\n| P000492 | 7.5% |\n| P000796 | 7.4% |\n| P001269 | 7.2% |\n| P000780 | 7.1% |\n| P000551 | 7.0% |\n\n[1]\n\n**Limitations:** The prediction covers a 60-day horizon from the model's anchor time (the `claim_denial_60d` template uses 2026-10-01 as its anchor). The results reflect the model's estimated likelihood, not certainty — these are the patients the model ranks highest for this outcome.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] NVIDIA Kumo prediction result — healthcare.clinical — evidence `hermes-receipt:7d2479a854f8ee259c0755de95e26e306b28e321ee55145e64345deef3950e33`",
